<title>USA: First Merchants note offering effective.</title>
<headline>First Merchants note offering effective.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Merchants Acceptance Corp said the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission declared effective the company's registration statement relating to an offering of $45 million worth of 9.5-percent subordinated reset notes.</p>
<p>The notes will be due December 15, 2006.</p>
<p>First Merchants is a specialty finance company.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
